# Engineering Playbook v0.3 Amendment 1 - Sprint 1

**Base document:** `V0.3 Quality_Gates`
**Amendment date:** November 5, 2026
**Status:** Effective for the remainder of the semester

This amendment records the Sprint 1 changes to v0.3. The fenced block is the
diff against v0.3; each hunk is followed by its rationale.

